	(text "K1/K2 OFF = REFERENCE. ON = AV. K3 OFF = PASS. ON = output shorted to its own return.\nAll RCA shells must be insulated from the enclosure. Keep each signal with its corresponding return."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
